# handle-hover-move (h7-plane, re-pinned by ea29aa9 at c6754e7): the pointer
# from the diamond straight onto the square in ONE move. The hover-end and the
# new hover fire in the same move, but hovering is now the hovered index
# (ea29aa9): grab-hover, with a and b lit and h and k not. A stepped move would
# re-hover; the single jump is the state.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query func=x2&a=2&h=1&k=-3
wait 500
move 978 640
wait 300
move 1028 540
wait 300
shot handle-hover-move
